	<section_number>5.1-11</section_number>
	<catch_line>Government-owned aircraft</catch_line>
	<text>
		This article shall not apply to public aircraft owned by the United States but shall apply to all other public aircraft.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 5-14; 1966, c. 576; 1980, c. 721.</history>
